WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.800
Share one iPad between learners.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.800
Several learners can share one iPad.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.600
Each has their own board, stage, look and data.

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Adult tools sit behind a 3-second hold and a passcode,
so a child cannot open them by accident.

5
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Hold the small circle on the board
for 3 seconds,

6
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:33.000
then enter the passcode.

7
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:41.500
Keep the passcode private, so only adults
can open the adult tools.

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
